Subject: [PATCH 2334/3799] soh: rename func_8097A6C0 ->
 DemoGj_CheckRisingPile4

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: once Ganondorf starts rising, launches rubble pile 4 and switches it to update mode 11
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c
index 672d2cf2c..24853df92 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c
@@ -766,7 +766,8 @@ void DemoGj_TumbleRubblePile4(DemoGj* this, PlayState* play) {
     DemoGj_SetupRotation(this, play);
 }
 
-void func_8097A6C0(DemoGj* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8097A6C0: once Ganondorf starts rising, launches rubble pile 4 and switches it to update mode 11
+void DemoGj_CheckRisingPile4(DemoGj* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (DemoGj_IsGanondorfRisingFromRubble(this, play)) {
         DemoGj_SetupMovement(this, play);
         this->updateMode = 11;
@@ -783,7 +784,7 @@ void func_8097A70C(DemoGj* this, PlayState* play) {
 // func_8097A73C
 void DemoGj_Update04(DemoGj* this, PlayState* play) {
     DemoGj_FindGanon(this, play);
-    func_8097A6C0(this, play);
+    DemoGj_CheckRisingPile4(this, play);  // was func_8097A6C0 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 // func_8097A76C
